# Capture the LATE crash evidence (FAT fix in): boot &, wait for ERRFATAL
# (long window - it now happens deep in the boot, not at 2.5 s), then read
# the probe lines P / EF / W.
LABEL boot SINTRAN via bare &
SEND &
LABEL waiting for the (late) crash
EXPECT 900 ERRFATAL
LABEL probe read-history line
EXPECT 30 P [0-7]{6}
LABEL EF register line
EXPECT 30 EF [0-7]{6}
LABEL W device-traffic line
EXPECT 30 W [RW][0-7]
PAUSE 5
